        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: J. Searle Dawley, James Searle Dawley, Lionel Ngakane\n- Roles: director, screenwriter, filmmaker, actor\n- Works: Jemima & Johnny\n- Events: 1966 Venice Film Festival\n\nFacts:\n- James Searle Dawley, also known as J. Searle Dawley, was an American director and screenwriter who lived from May 13, 1877 to March 30, 1949.\n- Lionel Ngakane was a South African filmmaker and actor who lived from 17 July 1928 to 26 November 2003.\n- Jemima & Johnny was the first film by South African filmmaker Lionel Ngakane.\n- Jemima & Johnny won a plate at the 1966 Venice Film Festival.",
